# Intro

msgid "intro.slide_1"
msgstr "They say that the world collapsed because of the \"White Noise\". But I know it's all the foxes' fault. Until the end of the world, they were bred for fur coats. And now they're taking revenge."

msgid "intro.slide_2"
msgstr "At first they were just wild. But every winter made them fiercer. But they know how to wait."

msgid "intro.slide_3"
msgstr "I built my farm out of blue wood. They say foxes can't stand this color. But I still see them watching me. They're just waiting for me to fall asleep. Every night they come to the fence. They need my eggs and my birds. I have an old crossbow on the roof to keep them away from the gate. Let's see if I can hold out for another day..."

